  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/c0j5U9v2oJWEzSTKvdDLWZ5Zik3PBUXk-C9w3Ma990WH63rpQUfA7g-3wh_uT7CgFvFJ4jPGEeOw509FxSgfh78_HR9tDNZ9KitXdEveKsLaLMgPQf6YSDt1b775728JMVp9FIQs=s0] \n\n**Given equation:** 9 × (34 - 15) + (105 ÷ 7) + 28 + (13 × 4) = 218\n\n \n\n**1) Interchanging 15 and 13**\n\nNew equation: 9 × __**(34 - 13)**__ + __**(105 ÷ 7) **__+ 28 + __**(15 × 4)**__\n\n= __**9 × 21**__ + 15 + 28 + 60\n\n= __**189 + 15**__ + 28 + 60\n\n= __**204 + 28**__ + 60\n\n= __**232 + 60**__\n\n= 292 ≠ 218 (Incorrect)\n\n**2) Interchanging 15 and 7**\n\nNew equation: 9 × __**(34 - 7)**__ + __**(105 ÷ 15)**__ + 28 +__** (13 × 4)**__\n\n=__** 9 × 27**__ **+ **7 + 28 + 52\n\n= __**243 + 7**__ + 28 + 52\n\n= __**250 + 28**__ + 52\n\n= __**278 + 52**__\n\n= 330 ≠ 218 (Incorrect)\n\n**3) Interchanging 28 and 15**\n\nNew equation: 9 ×__** (34 - 28)**__ + __**(105 ÷ 7)**__ + 15 + __**(13 × 4)**__\n\n= __**9 × 6**__ + 15 + 15 + 52\n\n= __**54 + 15**__ + 15 + 52\n\n= __**69 + 15**__ + 52\n\n= __**84 + 52**__\n\n= 136 ≠ 218 (Incorrect)\n\n**4) Interchanging 34 and 28**\n\nNew equation: 9 × (__**28 - 15)**__ +__** (105 ÷ 7) **__+ 34 +__** (13 × 4)**__\n\n= __**9 × 13**__ + 15 + 34 + 52\n\n= __**117 + 15**__ + 34 + 52\n\n= __**132 + 34**__ + 52\n\n= __**166 + 52**__\n\n= 218\n\n218 = 218 (Correct)\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
